# FlowCart AI Rules

- Never replace real functionality with mocks just to make the application appear complete.
- Domain logic must not depend on Spring or JPA annotations on aggregates.
- Use BigDecimal / Money for monetary values — never floating point for money.
- Inventory invariants: available_qty >= 0, successful reservations never oversell.
- A feature is complete only when acceptance criteria are verified with real tests or smoke checks.
- Prefer modular monolith packages first; do not create empty microservice shells.
- Keep docs/PROGRESS.md honest: COMPLETED / IN PROGRESS / BLOCKED / NEXT.
- AI / RAG / Chaos features must wait until commerce domain (M0–M2) is stable.
